---
layout: base.njk
title: "Contact Bhawani Growth — Free SEO Mini-Audit for Small Businesses"
description: "Get in touch for a free SEO mini-audit. Message on WhatsApp, call, email, or use the contact form — Bhawani Growth replies within one business day."
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Get a free mini-audit</h1>
    <p class="lede">Send your site over and I'll reply with three specific things you can fix this week — no cost, no pressure, no contract.</p>
    <div class="contact-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-details">
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
      <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Or send the details here</h2>
    <form name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" class="contact-form">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
      <p class="visually-hidden">
        <label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
      </p>
      <label for="name">Name</label>
      <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>

      <label for="email">Email</label>
      <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>

      <label for="website">Your website (optional)</label>
      <input type="text" id="website" name="website">

      <label for="message">What do you need help with?</label>
      <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>

      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
